  "semanticFamilyReview": [
    "Queue model restoration, relation omission and restoration constraint loss assess different parts of serialized model behavior.",
    "Dispatch uniqueness, until-processing release, shared-store coordination, processing overlap and cross-class lock identity have separate scopes/lifetimes.",
    "Release control flow, reservation attempt counting, rate-limit budgets, deadline eligibility and worker timeout are distinct operational failure paths.",
    "Chains express order and stop on failure; batches express independent work, failure cancellation and completion callbacks.",
    "Synchronous event dispatch after commit differs from enqueueing a job after commit. Neither is presented as a durable outbox.",
    "Queued locale preservation, recipient accumulation, envelope addressing, MIME representations and inline CID data test separate mail contracts.",
    "Mail and notification fake assertions use their actual framework APIs. Rendered-content testing is explicitly separate from dispatch intent.",
    "Scheduler execution overlap, single-server election, occurrence names, TTL units, environment filters, maintenance mode, recurring trigger and deployment interruption are distinguished.",
    "The new bank preserves one assessment per specific objective. Shared inactive legacy curriculum is disclosed without claiming that standard framework concepts were invented here."
  ],
